    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδι-ορθόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>straighten at the same time, set</i> a dislocated
